<title>DENMARK: Salomon rates Denmark's BG Bank as buy.</title>
<headline>Salomon rates Denmark's BG Bank as buy.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers on Monday rated Denmark's BG Bank for the first time, classing it as a buy.</p>
<p>In an analysis of Danish banks it maintained hold recommendations on Den Danske Bank and Unidanmark.</p>
</text>
